{"articleNo":"1549","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1549&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"겨울계절수업 대구통학버스 증차 및 노선 변경 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.12.21","hit":"11103","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">2010학년도 겨울</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">계절수업 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">대구통학버스를 승차인원 증가로 인하여&nbsp;증차</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(1대→2대)하여 운행하오니 다음과 같이 운행아오니&nbsp;착오 없으시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 운행조건 : 2대 각1회(등․하교) 운행<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">운행기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 12. 22(수) ~ 2011. 1. 14(금) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">[15일]<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제외일자 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">12월29일(수), 1월5일(수), 1월12일(수) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">[3일],&nbsp;토요일, 공휴일<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 운행대수 : 45인승 1대<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. 운행일시 : <font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong>2010년 12월23일부터</strong></font></span>&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">. 운행노선&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;가. 등교&nbsp;<br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서부정류장(07:20)→광장코아(07:30)→성서홈플러스(07:40)→학교(08:40)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 만촌역(07:20)→범어로타리(07:25)→시민회관(07:30)→평리네거리(07:40)→학교(08:40)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 하교<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(16:30)→성서홈플러스(17:30)→광장코아(17:40)→서부정류장(17:50)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(16:30)→평리네거리(17:30)→시민회관(17:40)→범어로타리(17:50)→남부정류장(18:00)</font></span></span><spa